IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cbca-core`
IMPORT `cb5-nouns`
IMPORT `cb5-seat`

-- CASES for cb5-seat.l4, the seat layer of the Canada Business Corporations Act, Parts XIX to XXI, the Schedule
-- and the Related Provisions (R.S.C. 1985, c. C-44).
--
-- UNOFFICIAL. The text this was encoded from is a plain-text rendering of the Department of Justice Canada
-- consolidation current to 2026-09-30; it is not an official version and has not been verified against one.
--
-- Every question of the seat layer has at least one case here, and most have a case that answers yes and a case
-- that answers no. The expected values are written from the section named beside each question, in the order of
-- the question's inputs (each question lists them in the order of its GIVEN); none is copied from a run. A
-- question whose cases are phrased exactly as a rule of the layer-1 modules is tested there with its own
-- hand-written expected values (the cb5-tests-*.l4 files); the cases here re-state those expected values at
-- the seat's wording and input order, so that a slip in the order of the seat's inputs shows up as a failure.
-- The cases where the Act does not answer the question (a figure or a fact the Act leaves to the regulations,
-- or a market that is not an organized market) are asserted as NOTHING, or as a plain NO, and say so beside them.

§ `Cases of the seat layer`

§§ `Investigation (Part XIX)`

-- May I apply to the court for an investigation of the corporation?
-- s 229(1): a security holder, in the court of the registered office.
#ASSERT `May I apply to the court for an investigation of the corporation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May I apply to the court for an investigation of the corporation` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May I apply to the court for an investigation of the corporation` TRUE FALSE)
-- May the court order an investigation of the corporation (s 229(2))?
#ASSERT `May the court order an investigation of the corporation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `May the court order an investigation of the corporation` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court order an investigation of the corporation` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court order an investigation of the corporation` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- Must I give the Director notice of my application for an investigation?
-- s 229(3): the security-holder applicant owes the notice; one who holds no security is not an applicant under subsection (1).
#ASSERT `Must I give the Director notice of my application for an investigation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Must I give the Director notice of my application for an investigation` FALSE)
-- Have I complied with my duty to give the Director notice of my application for an investigation?
-- s 229(3): the security-holder applicant owes the notice and has complied once the Director was given reasonable notice; one who holds no security has no such duty.
#ASSERT `Have I complied with my duty to give the Director notice of my application for an investigation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I complied with my duty to give the Director notice of my application for an investigation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Have I complied with my duty to give the Director notice of my application for an investigation` FALSE FALSE
-- Is the Director entitled to appear and be heard on my application for an investigation (s 229(3))?
#ASSERT `Is the Director entitled to appear and be heard on my application for an investigation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the Director entitled to appear and be heard on my application for an investigation` FALSE)
-- Must I give security for costs on my application for an investigation?
-- s 229(4): an applicant is not required to give security for costs.
#ASSERT NOT `Must I give security for costs on my application for an investigation`
-- Must my application for an investigation be heard in camera (s 229(5))?
#ASSERT `Must my application for an investigation be heard in camera` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Must my application for an investigation be heard in camera` FALSE)
-- May I publish something about ex parte proceedings for an investigation (s 229(6))?
#ASSERT `May I publish something about ex parte proceedings for an investigation` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `May I publish something about ex parte proceedings for an investigation` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May I publish something about ex parte proceedings for an investigation` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- May the court make this kind of order in an investigation of the corporation (s 230(1))?
#ASSERT `May the court make this kind of order in an investigation of the corporation` `an order to investigate (s 230(1)(a))` TRUE
#ASSERT `May the court make this kind of order in an investigation of the corporation` `an order appointing, remunerating or replacing an inspector (s 230(1)(b))` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make this kind of order in an investigation of the corporation` `an order requiring any person to produce documents or records to the inspector (s 230(1)(e))` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make this kind of order in an investigation of the corporation` `any other order the court thinks fit (s 230(1))` FALSE)
-- Can the inspector use this power over me (s 231(1))?
#ASSERT `Can the inspector use this power over me` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Can the inspector use this power over me` FALSE)
-- May the inspector pass what I told them on to another public official (s 231(2))?
#ASSERT `May the inspector pass what I told them on to another public official` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the inspector pass what I told them on to another public official` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the inspector pass what I told them on to another public official` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- Am I entitled to a copy of the order that appointed the inspector (s 231(3))?
#ASSERT `Am I entitled to a copy of the order that appointed the inspector` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to a copy of the order that appointed the inspector` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to a copy of the order that appointed the inspector` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- May I apply to the court for an in camera hearing and directions (s 232(1))?
#ASSERT `May I apply to the court for an in camera hearing and directions` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May I apply to the court for an in camera hearing and directions` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May I apply to the court for an in camera hearing and directions` TRUE FALSE)
-- Do I have a right to be represented by counsel at the inspector's hearing (s 232(2))?
#ASSERT `Do I have a right to be represented by counsel at the inspector's hearing` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Do I have a right to be represented by counsel at the inspector's hearing` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Do I have a right to be represented by counsel at the inspector's hearing` FALSE FALSE)
-- Am I excused from giving evidence to an inspector because it may incriminate me?
-- s 233: a person is not excused by reason only that the evidence may tend to criminate.
#ASSERT NOT `Am I excused from giving evidence to an inspector because it may incriminate me`
-- Can what I tell an inspector be used against me later (s 233)?
#ASSERT `Can what I tell an inspector be used against me later` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 233 bars the use of the evidence against the person`
#ASSERT `Can what I tell an inspector be used against me later` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 233 does not bar the use of the evidence against the person`
-- s 233: the bar reaches only a later proceeding instituted against the person under an Act of Parliament, and not a prosecution for perjury in giving the evidence or under s 136 of the Criminal Code in respect of it.
#ASSERT `Can what I tell an inspector be used against me later` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 233 does not bar the use of the evidence against the person`
#ASSERT `Can what I tell an inspector be used against me later` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 233 does not bar the use of the evidence against the person`
#ASSERT `Can what I tell an inspector be used against me later` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 233 does not bar the use of the evidence against the person`
#ASSERT `Can what I tell an inspector be used against me later` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `s 233 does not bar the use of the evidence against the person`
-- Am I protected by absolute privilege for what I say or write in an investigation (s 234)?
#ASSERT `Am I protected by absolute privilege for what I say or write in an investigation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I protected by absolute privilege for what I say or write in an investigation` FALSE)
-- Can the Director require me to report who owns or controls a security (s 235(1))?
#ASSERT `Can the Director require me to report who owns or controls a security` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Can the Director require me to report who owns or controls a security` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Can the Director require me to report who owns or controls a security` TRUE FALSE)
-- Have I made the report the Director required of me (s 235(1))?
#ASSERT `Have I made the report the Director required of me` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I made the report the Director required of me` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I made the report the Director required of me` FALSE TRUE)
-- Am I deemed to have an interest or right in a security (s 235(2))?
#ASSERT `Am I deemed to have an interest or right in a security` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I deemed to have an interest or right in a security` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I deemed to have an interest or right in a security` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- Will the Director publish the particulars I reported (s 235(3))?
#ASSERT `Will the Director publish the particulars I reported` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Will the Director publish the particulars I reported` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Will the Director publish the particulars I reported` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- Am I guilty of an offence if I do not give the report the Director requires (s 235(4))?
#ASSERT `Am I guilty of an offence if I do not give the report the Director requires` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I guilty of an offence if I do not give the report the Director requires` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I guilty of an offence if I do not give the report the Director requires` FALSE FALSE)
-- What is the largest fine I could face for failing to give the report?
-- s 235(4): a fine not exceeding five thousand dollars.
#ASSERT `What is the largest fine I could face for failing to give the report` EQUALS 5000
-- What is the longest imprisonment I could face for failing to give the report?
-- s 235(4): imprisonment not exceeding six months.
#ASSERT `What is the longest imprisonment I could face for failing to give the report` EQUALS 6
-- As a director or officer, am I guilty when my body corporate fails to give the report (s 235(5))?
#ASSERT `As a director or officer, am I guilty when my body corporate fails to give the report` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`As a director or officer, am I guilty when my body corporate fails to give the report` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`As a director or officer, am I guilty when my body corporate fails to give the report` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- What is the largest fine I could face as a director or officer who authorized the failure to report?
-- s 235(5) with s 235(4): the director or officer is liable to the same punishment, a fine not exceeding five thousand dollars.
#ASSERT `What is the largest fine I could face as a director or officer who authorized the failure to report` EQUALS 5000
-- What is the longest imprisonment I could face as a director or officer who authorized the failure to report?
-- s 235(5) with s 235(4): imprisonment not exceeding six months.
#ASSERT `What is the longest imprisonment I could face as a director or officer who authorized the failure to report` EQUALS 6
-- Does the investigation Part take away my solicitor-client privilege?
-- s 236: Part XIX does not affect solicitor-client privilege or professional secrecy.
#ASSERT NOT `Does the investigation Part take away my solicitor-client privilege`
-- Can the Director make inquiries of me and require records (s 237(1))?
#ASSERT `Can the Director make inquiries of me and require records` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Can the Director make inquiries of me and require records` FALSE)
-- Have I complied with my duty to respond to the Director's inquiry (s 237(2))?
#ASSERT `Have I complied with my duty to respond to the Director's inquiry` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `Have I complied with my duty to respond to the Director's inquiry` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I complied with my duty to respond to the Director's inquiry` TRUE FALSE)

§§ `Apportioning an award of damages (Part XIX.1)`

-- Is what I hold a financial interest for the apportionment Part (s 237.1)?
#ASSERT `Is what I hold a financial interest for the apportionment Part` `a security (s 237.1 "financial interest" (a))` FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Is what I hold a financial interest for the apportionment Part` `an income or annuity contract (s 237.1 "financial interest" (h))` FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is what I hold a financial interest for the apportionment Part` `an income or annuity contract (s 237.1 "financial interest" (h))` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is what I hold a financial interest for the apportionment Part` `anything prescribed to be a financial interest (s 237.1 "financial interest" (j))` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- Is my loss a financial loss for the apportionment Part (s 237.1)?
#ASSERT `Is my loss a financial loss for the apportionment Part` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my loss a financial loss for the apportionment Part` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my loss a financial loss for the apportionment Part` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- Am I a third party for the apportionment Part (s 237.1)?
#ASSERT `Am I a third party for the apportionment Part` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a third party for the apportionment Part` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I a third party for the apportionment Part` FALSE FALSE)
-- Does the apportionment Part govern the damages awarded in my claim (s 237.2; S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 233)?
#ASSERT `Does the apportionment Part govern the damages awarded in my claim` TRUE 2 `any other plaintiff (s 237.2(2))` FALSE (YMD 2010 6 1) (YMD 2002 1 1)
#ASSERT `Does the apportionment Part govern the damages awarded in my claim` TRUE 2 `an agent of Her Majesty, a Crown corporation or a government agency (s 237.2(2)(b))` TRUE (YMD 2010 6 1) (YMD 2002 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`Does the apportionment Part govern the damages awarded in my claim` TRUE 1 `any other plaintiff (s 237.2(2))` FALSE (YMD 2010 6 1) (YMD 2002 1 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`Does the apportionment Part govern the damages awarded in my claim` TRUE 2 `a charitable organization, private foundation or public foundation (s 237.2(2)(c))` FALSE (YMD 2010 6 1) (YMD 2002 1 1))
-- How much of the damages am I liable for as a defendant (dollars) (s 237.3(1))?
#ASSERT `How much of the damages am I liable for as a defendant` 100000 (40%) EQUALS 40000
#ASSERT `How much of the damages am I liable for as a defendant` 250000 (10%) EQUALS 25000
-- By what day may the plaintiff apply to reallocate an uncollectable amount (s 237.3(2))?
#ASSERT `By what day may the plaintiff apply to reallocate an uncollectable amount` (YMD 2025 3 10) EQUALS YMD 2026 3 10
-- May the court reallocate an uncollectable amount to me as another responsible defendant (s 237.3(2))?
#ASSERT `May the court reallocate an uncollectable amount to me as another responsible defendant` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2025 3 10) (YMD 2026 3 10)
#ASSERT `May the court reallocate an uncollectable amount to me as another responsible defendant` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2025 3 10) (YMD 2025 3 11)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court reallocate an uncollectable amount to me as another responsible defendant` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2025 3 10) (YMD 2026 3 11))
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court reallocate an uncollectable amount to me as another responsible defendant` FALSE TRUE (YMD 2025 3 10) (YMD 2025 3 11))
-- What is the most that can be reallocated to me?
-- s 237.3(3), (4): the uncollectable amount times the other's share of the loss, but at most half what was awarded against that defendant.
#ASSERT `What is the most that can be reallocated to me` 20000 (25%) 20000 EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `What is the most that can be reallocated to me` 80000 (50%) 20000 EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most that can be reallocated to me` 80000 (50%) 100000 EQUALS 40000
-- Can the plaintiff recover the whole of the damages from me because I acted fraudulently or dishonestly (s 237.4(1))?
#ASSERT `Can the plaintiff recover the whole of the damages from me because I acted fraudulently or dishonestly` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Can the plaintiff recover the whole of the damages from me because I acted fraudulently or dishonestly` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Can the plaintiff recover the whole of the damages from me because I acted fraudulently or dishonestly` FALSE TRUE)
-- Am I entitled to claim contribution from the other defendants after a fraud finding against me (s 237.4(2))?
#ASSERT `Am I entitled to claim contribution from the other defendants after a fraud finding against me` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to claim contribution from the other defendants after a fraud finding against me` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I entitled to claim contribution from the other defendants after a fraud finding against me` FALSE TRUE)
-- Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor?
-- s 237.5(1)(b): a total financial interest equal to the prescribed amount is within it (not more than the prescribed amount).
#ASSERT `Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 5 25) 0 TRUE 100000 100000 FALSE FALSE
-- s 237.5(1), (1.1): an individual who held an interest on the day of the error, or acquired one by the day of disclosure, and whose total interest was at most the prescribed amount, unless suing as a partner or association member or as a trustee, liquidator, receiver or sequestrator.
#ASSERT `Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 5 25) 0 TRUE 50000 100000 FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 5 25) 0 TRUE 50000 100000 FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 5 25) 0 TRUE 50000 100000 FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 5 25) 0 TRUE 50000 100000 TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 5 25) 0 TRUE 50000 100000 FALSE TRUE)
-- A plaintiff who first acquired an interest between the two days, at a close-of-business value of at most the prescribed amount.
#ASSERT `Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) TRUE (YMD 2024 5 25) 90000 TRUE 500000 100000 FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) TRUE (YMD 2024 5 25) 100001 TRUE 500000 100000 FALSE FALSE)
-- Above the prescribed amount on the day of the error: not covered by subsection (1); section 237.6 may still reach it.
#ASSERT NOT (`Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 5 25) 0 TRUE 100001 100000 FALSE FALSE)
-- Value not established: not covered.
#ASSERT NOT (`Are the defendants jointly and severally liable to me as an investor` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 5 25) 0 FALSE 50000 100000 FALSE FALSE)
-- Is my body corporate a personal body corporate (s 237.5(2)(a))?
#ASSERT `Is my body corporate a personal body corporate` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my body corporate a personal body corporate` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my body corporate a personal body corporate` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my body corporate a personal body corporate` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- Am I in a common-law partnership with this person for the apportionment Part (s 237.5(2)(b))?
#ASSERT `Am I in a common-law partnership with this person for the apportionment Part` TRUE 1
#ASSERT `Am I in a common-law partnership with this person for the apportionment Part` TRUE 7
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I in a common-law partnership with this person for the apportionment Part` TRUE 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I in a common-law partnership with this person for the apportionment Part` FALSE 10)
-- May the court hold the defendants jointly and severally liable to me even though my holding is above the prescribed amount (s 237.6)?
#ASSERT `May the court hold the defendants jointly and severally liable to me even though my holding is above the prescribed amount` 100001 100000 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court hold the defendants jointly and severally liable to me even though my holding is above the prescribed amount` 100000 100000 TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court hold the defendants jointly and severally liable to me even though my holding is above the prescribed amount` 500000 100000 FALSE)
-- On what basis am I liable for the damages awarded (s 237.3(1), s 237.4 to s 237.6)?
#ASSERT `On what basis am I liable for the damages awarded` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `liable only for the portion of the damages that corresponds to their degree of responsibility`
#ASSERT `On what basis am I liable for the damages awarded` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `liable for the whole amount of the damages awarded because they acted fraudulently or dishonestly`
-- What is the value of my security for the apportionment Part?
-- s 237.7(1): the closing price; failing that, the average of the highest and lowest prices; for a security not traded that day, the average of the bid and ask prices; NOTHING where the figures needed are not given or the market is not organized.
#ASSERT `What is the value of my security for the apportionment Part` TRUE TRUE 10 TRUE 12 8 TRUE TRUE 9 11 EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `What is the value of my security for the apportionment Part` TRUE FALSE 0 TRUE 15 5 TRUE FALSE 0 0 EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `What is the value of my security for the apportionment Part` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE 0 0 FALSE TRUE 9 11 EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `What is the value of my security for the apportionment Part` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE 0 0 FALSE TRUE 8 12 EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `What is the value of my security for the apportionment Part` FALSE TRUE 10 TRUE 12 8 TRUE TRUE 9 11 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `What is the value of my security for the apportionment Part` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE 0 0 TRUE FALSE 0 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- May the court adjust the value of my security (s 237.7(2))?
#ASSERT `May the court adjust the value of my security` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court adjust the value of my security` FALSE)
-- As of what day is the value of my security determined?
-- s 237.7(3): the day of the error, unless the security was acquired in the period between that day and the day of general disclosure, when it is the day of acquisition.
#ASSERT `As of what day is the value of my security determined` (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) FALSE (YMD 2024 1 1) EQUALS YMD 2024 5 10
#ASSERT `As of what day is the value of my security determined` (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) TRUE (YMD 2024 5 25) EQUALS YMD 2024 5 25
#ASSERT `As of what day is the value of my security determined` (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) TRUE (YMD 2024 6 10) EQUALS YMD 2024 6 10
#ASSERT `As of what day is the value of my security determined` (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) TRUE (YMD 2024 6 11) EQUALS YMD 2024 5 10
#ASSERT `As of what day is the value of my security determined` (YMD 2024 5 10) (YMD 2024 6 10) TRUE (YMD 2024 5 9) EQUALS YMD 2024 5 10
-- Is this an organized market for my security (s 237.7(4))?
#ASSERT `Is this an organized market for my security` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Is this an organized market for my security` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is this an organized market for my security` FALSE FALSE)
-- Must the court determine the value of my financial interest itself (s 237.8(1))?
#ASSERT `Must the court determine the value of my financial interest itself` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Must the court determine the value of my financial interest itself` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Must the court determine the value of my financial interest itself` FALSE FALSE)
-- May I ask the court to determine the value of my financial interest (s 237.9)?
#ASSERT `May I ask the court to determine the value of my financial interest` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May I ask the court to determine the value of my financial interest` FALSE)

§§ `Remedies (Part XX)`

-- Am I a complainant who may use the remedies Part (s 238)?
#ASSERT `Am I a complainant who may use the remedies Part` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a complainant who may use the remedies Part` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I a complainant who may use the remedies Part` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- Is this an action under the remedies Part (s 238)?
#ASSERT `Is this an action under the remedies Part` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is this an action under the remedies Part` FALSE)
-- May I apply to the court for leave to bring an action in the corporation's name (s 239(1))?
#ASSERT `May I apply to the court for leave to bring an action in the corporation's name` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May I apply to the court for leave to bring an action in the corporation's name` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May I apply to the court for leave to bring an action in the corporation's name` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- Have I given the directors enough notice before applying for leave (s 239(2)(a))?
#ASSERT `Have I given the directors enough notice before applying for leave` (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 15) FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `Have I given the directors enough notice before applying for leave` (YMD 2026 3 2) (YMD 2026 3 15) TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I given the directors enough notice before applying for leave` (YMD 2026 3 2) (YMD 2026 3 15) FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I given the directors enough notice before applying for leave` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 3 15) FALSE FALSE)
-- May the court let the action be brought for the corporation (s 239(2))?
#ASSERT `May the court let the action be brought for the corporation` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court let the action be brought for the corporation` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court let the action be brought for the corporation` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- May the court make this kind of order in a derivative action (s 240)?
#ASSERT `May the court make this kind of order in a derivative action` `an order authorizing the complainant or any other person to control the conduct of the action (s 240(a))` TRUE
#ASSERT `May the court make this kind of order in a derivative action` `an order giving directions for the conduct of the action (s 240(b))` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make this kind of order in a derivative action` `any other order the court thinks fit in connection with the action (s 240)` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make this kind of order in a derivative action` `an order giving directions for the conduct of the action (s 240(b))` FALSE)
-- May I apply to the court for relief from oppression (s 241(1))?
#ASSERT `May I apply to the court for relief from oppression` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May I apply to the court for relief from oppression` FALSE)
-- May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive?
-- s 241(2): after an application, the court must be satisfied of one of the three limbs and that the result or manner is oppressive or unfairly prejudicial or unfairly disregards the interests of a security holder, creditor, director or officer.
#ASSERT `May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make an order to rectify what I complain of as oppressive` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- May the court make this kind of order on my oppression application (s 241(3))?
#ASSERT `May the court make this kind of order on my oppression application` `an order restraining the conduct complained of (s 241(3)(a))` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `May the court make this kind of order on my oppression application` `an order appointing a receiver or receiver-manager (s 241(3)(b))` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make this kind of order on my oppression application` `an order directing the corporation or any other person to purchase securities of a security holder (s 241(3)(f))` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May the court make this kind of order on my oppression application` `an order directing the corporation or any other person to pay a security holder part of the money the security holder paid for securities (s 241(3)(g))` TRUE TRUE)
-- As a director, must I comply forthwith with the articles-amendment duty after an oppression order (s 241(4)(a))?
#ASSERT `As a director, must I comply forthwith with the articles-amendment duty after an oppression order` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`As a director, must I comply forthwith with the articles-amendment duty after an oppression order` FALSE)
-- Is another amendment to the articles or by-laws barred, without the court's consent, after such an order (s 241(4)(b))?
#ASSERT `Is another amendment to the articles or by-laws barred, without the court's consent, after such an order` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is another amendment to the articles or by-laws barred, without the court's consent, after such an order` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is another amendment to the articles or by-laws barred, without the court's consent, after such an order` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- Am I barred from dissenting under section 190 from an amendment to the articles made under the oppression section (s 241(5))?
#ASSERT `Am I barred from dissenting under section 190 from an amendment to the articles made under the oppression section` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I barred from dissenting under section 190 from an amendment to the articles made under the oppression section` FALSE)
-- Must the corporation hold back a payment to me as a shareholder under an oppression order (s 241(6))?
#ASSERT `Must the corporation hold back a payment to me as a shareholder under an oppression order` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Must the corporation hold back a payment to me as a shareholder under an oppression order` TRUE FALSE TRUE
